and burn injury</article-title><source>Clin Sci (Lond)</source><year>2005</year><volume>108</volume><fpage>265</fpage><lpage>272</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15554871</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>